<title>UK: UK core cost pressures very subdued-Treasury.</title>
<headline>UK core cost pressures very subdued-Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK treasury said cost pressures at factory gates remained very subdued after the release of producer price data for December.</p>
<p>THE DATA SHOWED</p>
<p>===============</p>
<p>UK DEC OUTPUT PRICES +0.5% MM, +1.7% YY, INPUT PRICES S/A -0.5% MM, -5.9% YY</p>
<p>UK DEC S/A OUTPUT PRICES EX-FOOD,DRINK,TOBACCO,PETROL +0.1 MM, +0.8% YY</p>
</text>
